# The forked AAAI implementation, named file by file rather than as a directory.
# What it does not name is as deliberate as what it does: its `infra` holds the
# control plane, which never ships inside a trainer, and the rest of it is a
# hundred megabytes of configs, figures and a PDF that no image runs.
!rtrrl/*.py
!rtrrl/pyproject.toml
!rtrrl/uv.lock
!rtrrl/README.md
!rtrrl/catalog.json
!rtrrl/entries
!rtrrl/entries/**
!rtrrl/envs
!rtrrl/envs/**
!rtrrl/models
!rtrrl/models/**

